OL,3,GNEWSATalks on Drumcree parading dispute
OL,4,Aend without agreement
OL,5,
OL,6,FAgreement has not been reached on a
OL,7,Fresolution to the Drumcree parade
OL,8,Fdispute, Northern Ireland Secretary Sir
OL,9,FChris Bryant has said.
OL,11,FMembers of Portadown Orange Order and
OL,12,Fthe Garvaghy Road Residents' Coalition
OL,13,Fmet Sir Chris at Hillsborough Castle
OL,14,Ffor further talks on the Drumcree
OL,15,Fparading dispute on Thursday night.
OL,17,FSir Chris said after the talks that "we
OL,18,Fhaven't come to a settled agreement".
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
