OL,3,GNEWSATalks on Drumcree parading dispute
OL,4,Aend without agreement
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Tuesday, lawyers for the GRRC issued
OL,7,Fa fresh legal bid to try to prevent the
OL,8,Fmarch from going ahead. It was due to
OL,9,Fbe heard on Friday but has been
OL,10,Fpostponed until Monday to allow for
OL,11,Fmore talks involving the secretary of
OL,12,Fstate.
